<description>&lt;p&gt;South Sudan has again delayed its first post-independence elections, now set for February 2027 as violence escalates nationwide. A Juba League activist was killed in a mob beating linked to the murder of a Swechchhasebak Dal leader, and a lawmaker said women are fighting for rights, not punching men. Cattle-related clashes in Mundri have raised the death toll to 22, while a separate cattle raid in Juba left two people dead. The conflict continues to produce civilian casualties, with 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxONFRYSUk2SE44NXlFS0xYWm5BY0ExeE1iclByTXBIUGJ6ZkdNeDVBYzN3UlNZZlQ1dURHWVZwV05JWHl4d0J4dy1aNFNTaURvTFQxTHhhbnVJZ2kzTXZtbjlnaDVxd1JKS2FaVWVPc2haeXk3dXd4TmtMZmozVXk2dWh3TkFEZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Citizen Digital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQYk8wSTJNSU5jTGItWUxYdGxDbHJMRHJJTUdMMmhrTTdoNFAxcU1aM1F6UDd0OHRLX1Zuc2ZyRV9MQUpORVJBRENldXpGSlRsdENRdDdqUVdJa3VJRzBkVjBrWmdBU3VoRmdPRWNvNVVqOThqUGh4VVgwZTgxMVQzQnVDX2ZmQjVJR0JLdTFmLVZTd0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;IDN-InDepthNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxOLWxtTXFEcW1yRGV0Q3RLc05DWERFV0JSb0ZXUU95OXVzM1lnbzFTYl9lU3AxeDF5bWc4d3RCSEo3aXlNcEVsVEtVTndtd2ZqTTBEc1lmZHd6SkVWdnZVaWpVNlQ4ZXFEVVBHSGJfUnd2bUtCQU5FWlBNcGFNd3NRVkUyMVBmd213V3dIMHZiU0NuS0ZHQlhmRWJKZHhfU2ZqTDh6LV9ERFdFd0JCM2xDV1JHM1hncVBPWE1PSEJ3a2oxTWgzU2w0?oc=5&quot;&gt;New Age BD&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE9mVV8xWms1eTBESWU5RktjOGxrRTVMNkJhTE5MTzVSYXVRT20wZWJqQXAxYVBOQlJtVEJxVFUtb0Mtd041dmloN0JUMkRpUUd0Ry1UZkpPRXEwZFhMZFhxRTlnZG9ULVAy?oc=5&quot;